Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data 2025.

The files here are byte ranges, unchanged, of one cloud-optimised GeoTIFF
that the Microsoft Planetary Computer publishes, cut out of the whole file
to test reading by ranges. They are distributed under the Legal Notice on
the use of Copernicus Sentinel Data and Service Information:
https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/documents/247904/690755/Sentinel_Data_Legal_Notice

